  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1...Generally dry weather today through late next \nweek.\n\nKEY MESSAGE 1 DESCRIPTION...\nA strong surface high pressure will elongate across the\nnortheastern United States beginning on Sunday, and will \ngenerally control the weather through late next week. Strong\nlow-pressure system in the central Atlantic stays well to our\nstrong as a result. Weak cold front expected to move through on\nTuesday. However, with only limited moisture available, not \nanticipating rainfall with any of these fronts. As the original \nhigh slides eastward on Tuesday, additional ridging over \nsouthern Canada will move into the region continuing the dry \ntrend.",
